## Password Hashing

### Hash Password
```javascript
const bcrypt = require('bcryptjs');
const hash = await bcrypt.hash(password, 10);
```

### Verify Password
```javascript
const match = await bcrypt.compare(password, hash);
if (!match) {
  return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid password' });
}
```

